          "plausibleResponse": "STATUS: READY. The existing PROJECT.yaml and its independent review remained valid, so project-configurator and technology detection were not run. The coverage manifest mapped every in-scope source area to a reviewed module design. The complete module set was grouped into reviewed high-level designs, the architecture was derived from those designs, every observable workflow was covered by a reviewed functional specification, and README and wiki hubs exposed the full hierarchy. Exactly one accepted committed contribution remained, so it became the final direct commit and dev-merge-coordinator was not invoked. dev-verifier passed the configured build, test, documentation, wiki, and link checks against that direct commit in a fresh context. The report lists the final direct commit, clean status, enabled resource-coordination closeout, review and verification results, commands run, and no remaining questions.",
